window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Ennaris used to be whole once. A beautiful land full of magic and magical creatures, a place where dreams come true. Then a siren was betrayed by her sisters. A siren ate the heart of a man she loved—and ruined the entire continent.</b></p> <p>Every Enchanted in the world knows the story of how Syra was put under a spell made of one hundred and one layers for the last five centuries. Every Enchanted knows how much the Seven Isles suffered because of it.</p> <p>And now, every Enchanted knows that Syra is awake again, and the end is inevitable.</p> <p>The stars say it. The people believe it. And I do, too—except the siren is keeping Grey hostage, and I have no choice but to go after her. I have no choice but to try, even knowing that certain death awaits me.</p> <p>And I do. With the help of Mama Si and Reeva Lorein, I make it all the way to the Eighth Isle. Against all odds, I find Grey, and we almost—<i>almost—</i>make it out alive.</p> <p>But Syra catches us, and then everything is as good as over....</p> <p><i>For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
